#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:5 42c9163b8192479d898cf7437d31c673
msgid "Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX"
msgstr "Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:7 a8d472aa024c4d6483f92706c011b04c
msgid ""
"This is an open source LUA script to display :ref:`FrSky passthrough "
"telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` on Horus X10,X12, Jumper T16,T18, "
"Radiomaster TX16S, Taranis X9D,X9E,QX7 and Jumper T12 radios using OpenTX "
"2.2.3."
msgstr ""
"这是一个开源 LUA 脚本，使用 OpenTX 2.2.3 在 Horus X10、X12、Jumper T16、T18、Radiomaster "
"TX16S、Taranis X9D、X9E、QX7 和 Jumper T12 遥控器上显示 :ref:`FrSky 直通数传 <common-"
"frsky-passthrough>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:9 977eeb97dedd403e845ce4479e0c73ef
msgid ""
"This script can be used with FRSky, CRSF, or CRSF using the Passthru  option"
" (:ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 8 enbled when using CRSF)."
msgstr ""
"该脚本可与 FRSky、CRSF 配合使用，或使用直通选项的 CRSF（使用 CRSF 时启用 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 8 位）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:11
#: c94127d29b044a5ab4eba66db68ce91b
msgid "Support for dual flight batteries is also provided."
msgstr "同时提供对双飞行电池的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:13
#: a67cbca2da72408b8ea66f0c3658f90a
msgid ""
"Hardware details are shown in  :ref:`FrSky passthrough telemetry <common-"
"frsky-passthrough>` also."
msgstr "硬件详情也在 :ref:`FrSky 直通数传 <common-frsky-passthrough>` 中介绍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:16
#: b450f7e5dabf46ea846a822740a8ca34
msgid "Display on Horus, Jumper T16/T18 and Radiomaster TX16S"
msgstr "在 Horus、Jumper T16/T18 和 Radiomaster TX16S 上显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:21
#: 39a43f7c90b2477382f68beebdce174a
msgid "Display on Taranis"
msgstr "在 Taranis 上显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:26
#: 54c5589e426345c2bf7b0ca99d687f76
msgid "Display on QX7 and Jumper T12"
msgstr "在 QX7 和 Jumper T12 上显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:32
#: f4b4684e58994f8e9b2e0d40028f202a
msgid ""
"Details can be found `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/an-open-source-"
"frsky-telemetry-script-for-the-horus-x10-x12-and-taranis-x9d-x9e-and-"
"qx7-radios/26443>`__."
msgstr ""
"详情请访问 `此处 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/an-open-source-frsky-telemetry-"
"script-for-the-horus-x10-x12-and-taranis-x9d-x9e-and-qx7-radios/26443>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:34
#: 0923d4aa30bd49b89dea633d21f1d69d
msgid ""
"Latest script releases are `here "
"<https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/releases>`__."
msgstr ""
"最新脚本版本请访问 `此处 <https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/releases>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:36
#: 4d0f6a78a799482292f1c1db9fe637c8
msgid ""
"The script is also compatible with the excellent `MavlinkToPassthru "
"converter firmware <https://github.com/zs6buj/MavlinkToPassthru>`__ by Eric "
"Stockenstrom which allows alternative telemetry transport methods, such as "
"the data modem in DragonlinkRC RC systems, to feed MAVLink data into these "
"transmitters for display by this LUA script."
msgstr ""
"该脚本还与 Eric Stockenstrom 开发的优秀 `MavlinkToPassthru 转换器固件 "
"<https://github.com/zs6buj/MavlinkToPassthru>`__ 兼容，允许使用替代的数传传输方式（如 "
"DragonlinkRC 遥控系统中的数据调制解调器）将 MAVLink 数据馈送到这些遥控器，由该 LUA 脚本显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:38
#: b80b57da3aff4ed5b68bfe94ab67e0d2
msgid ""
"Requires `OpenTX 2.2.x <http://www.open-tx.org/>`__ (2.2.3 recommended) and "
"a recent release of ArduPilot with support for :ref:`common-frsky-"
"passthrough`."
msgstr ""
"需要 `OpenTX 2.2.x <http://www.open-tx.org/>`__（推荐 2.2.3）以及支持 :ref:`common-"
"frsky-passthrough` 的最新 ArduPilot 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:41
#: 84c99c61e3eb4f4090dbfdf81cdb1196
msgid "Installation and Operation"
msgstr "安装与使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:43
#: a426cabc33444934be0fbdb0adbf697c
msgid ""
"Complete instructions are provided in the wiki pages `here "
"<https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/wiki>`_ , but the general "
"steps are:"
msgstr ""
"完整说明请参见 `此处 <https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/wiki>`_ 的 Wiki "
"页面，基本步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:45
#: c5c76958b57244509c65760ef33bc494
msgid ""
"Copy the SD card directory contents provided in the code section of that "
"github site to your TX's SD card: Horus SD for Horus, T16, and T16s style "
"TXs; Taranis SD for all others."
msgstr ""
"将该 GitHub 站点代码区提供的 SD 卡目录内容复制到遥控器的 SD 卡：Horus SD 适用于 Horus、T16 和 T16s "
"类型遥控器；Taranis SD 适用于其他所有遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:46
#: f3e5f72beb374ed6b775545de4042a74
msgid ""
"On the telemetry display setup page of the TX (or telemetry widget for Horus"
" class TXs) choose the appropriate script as the source for the display "
"page. In the case of Taranis class, the ``yaapu7`` script is for the smaller"
" QX7 size displays, and the ``yaapu9`` is for the Taranix 9x size displays."
msgstr ""
"在遥控器的数传显示设置页面（或 Horus 类遥控器的数传小组件），选择适当的脚本作为显示页面的数据源。对于 Taranis "
"类遥控器，``yaapu7`` 脚本用于较小的 QX7 尺寸显示屏，``yaapu9`` 用于 Taranis 9x 尺寸显示屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:47
#: e88fed3bdb574c0aa48ffe229599a146
msgid "Setup the ArduPilot side (see :ref:`common-frsky-telemetry`)"
msgstr "设置 ArduPilot 端（参见 :ref:`common-frsky-telemetry`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:48
#: 671abd907c70449a8ced518f7ec12a69
msgid "On the TX telemetry page, \"discover sensors\"."
msgstr "在遥控器数传页面，「发现传感器」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:49
#: c0f5f2eaf8fe43869c1c7860a2cdd262
msgid ""
"The script will run on startup. On Horus the widget will display, on others,"
" you will need to page to the telemetry display page to see the data."
msgstr "脚本将在启动时运行。在 Horus 上将显示小组件；在其他遥控器上，需要翻页到数传显示页面才能看到数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:50
#: 6bb1aec040f047fe97334d370e3bd2b4
msgid ""
"There is a configuration screen for the script that allows customization of "
"warnings, units, etc."
msgstr "脚本有一个配置屏幕，允许自定义警告、单位等设置。"
